{"setting":"einszwei","title":"LOOK MUM NO COMPUTER · Eins, Zwei, Drei","description":"The complete supplied video. A teal office opens onto a wall of modular synths, CRT singers, a singing pizza and an orange winged Mini.","duration":209.67789115646258,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"eins-sam","name":"Sam","role":"Office verses and sung refrain","tele":"lead.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"eins-counter","name":"Pizza and CRTs","role":"German counts and machine replies","tele":"counter.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":10.61234,"end":13.495,"text":"So sick of doing the whole nine to five","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":14.47275,"end":17.24567,"text":"I pay my dues, I'm just staying alive","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":17.30067,"end":20.095,"text":"And I'm so bored of it, bored of it","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":21.0625,"end":24.16,"text":"Oh what's the point of it, point of it?","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":25.7265,"end":28.555,"text":"A paracetamol to quench the pain","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":29.51179,"end":32.365,"text":"The office cubicle has trapped me again","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":32.4356,"end":35.175,"text":"Am I a mouse in a cage, am I?","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":36.40785,"end":39.215,"text":"Duh duh duh demotivational","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":41.08262,"end":43.46,"text":"Ah, if only there was a language","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":43.6,"end":44.85984,"text":"That I could count in","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":44.92484,"end":46.81,"text":"That would make me feel better","speaker":"eins-sam","intensity":0.83},{"start":47.12672,"end":48.51,"text":"Oh yah!","speaker":"eins-counter","intensity":0.83},{"start":50.19899,"end":51.36118,"text":"Eins, zwei, drei","speaker":"eins-counter","intensity":0.83},{"start":51.53516,"end":5